# Windsurf AI Rules

## Project Type
Documentation-only repository. No implementation code.

## Subject Matter
OpenAI Codex-RS TUI architecture for AI coding agents.

## Allowed Operations
- Edit markdown files in docs/
- Update llms.txt and llms-full.txt
- Add Mermaid diagrams
- Write Rust code snippets (documentation only)

## Forbidden Operations
- Creating source code files
- Adding package dependencies
- Modifying codex-architecture.html
- Running build commands

## Documentation Standards
- Concise, no filler words
- Use tables for mappings
- Include GitHub source links
- Validate Mermaid syntax

## Key Insight
TUI → ThreadManager (direct channel)
NOT: TUI → MessageProcessor → ThreadManager
